14. Interview Questions

How does TreeSet maintain order?
→ Using TreeMap (Red-Black Tree).

Why is insertion O(log n)?
→ Because each insert navigates the tree height.

Can you store null?
→ ❌ No.

Difference between HashSet and TreeSet?
→ HashSet uses HashMap (unordered), TreeSet uses TreeMap (sorted).

How to define custom sorting?
→ By passing a Comparator in constructor.

15. Summary

✅ Maintains sorted order
✅ Uses TreeMap (Red-Black Tree) internally
✅ No nulls or duplicates
✅ O(log n) for insertion, deletion, search
✅ Supports NavigableSet methods (range, floor, ceiling, etc.)